  "description": "Fitted to a clean recording of the machine, BD 909 Clean Medium F 05 (TR-909 From Mars): Tune near the top, the long sweep that is the 909's punch. 28 semitones that stay high (about 240 Hz at 5 ms, 165 Hz at 20 ms, 110 Hz at 40 ms) and settle at 49 Hz on C4, the recording's pitch, after about 150 ms. A biased drive makes the body lopsided, its negative half-cycles taller, and a zero-attack square edge opens it on a negative step. Maximum punch, for hard techno and EDM.",
